WEBVTT

00:08.076 --> 00:09.543
- ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.543 --> 00:11.345
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:11.345 --> 00:12.813
- I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.813 --> 00:14.615
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:14.615 --> 00:17.651
- * OHH...
-*哦...

00:17.651 --> 00:19.920
* WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:19.920 --> 00:21.922
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:21.922 --> 00:23.991
- * ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE *
- * 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的*

00:23.991 --> 00:25.659
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:25.659 --> 00:27.995
- * IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHING YOU WISH *
- * 如果是航海废话
成为您所希望的*

00:27.995 --> 00:29.497
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:29.497 --> 00:31.965
- * THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH *
- * 然后掉到甲板上
像鱼一样扑腾*

00:31.965 --> 00:33.901
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
- READY?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.901 --> 00:35.936
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:35.936 --> 00:37.871
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.871 --> 00:39.840
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.840 --> 00:41.075
- * SPONGEBOB
- * 海绵宝宝

00:41.075 --> 00:43.377
* SQUAREPANTS!
* 方裤！

00:43.377 --> 00:45.846
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.846 --> 00:48.149
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:48.149 --> 00:49.583
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:52.253 --> 00:55.256
[upbeat ukulele music]
[欢快的尤克里里音乐]

00:55.256 --> 01:00.261
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

01:02.830 --> 01:06.200
[SpongeBob inhaling]
[海绵宝宝吸气]

01:06.200 --> 01:08.836
- SPONGEBOB, HOW ABOUT
MORE KRABBY PATTIES
-海绵宝宝，怎么样
更多蟹肉饼

01:08.836 --> 01:10.338
AND LESS HEAVY BREATHING?
呼吸更顺畅？

01:10.338 --> 01:12.506
- [humming words
through closed mouth]
- [哼哼的话
通过闭着的嘴]

01:12.506 --> 01:13.741
[exhales]
[呼气]

01:13.741 --> 01:16.144
- [gulps air]
- [倒吸一口空气]

01:16.144 --> 01:17.578
- WOW!
- 哇！

01:17.578 --> 01:19.413
THAT'S THE LONGEST
I'VE HELD MY BREATH!
这是最长的
我屏住呼吸！

01:19.413 --> 01:20.981
THREE WHOLE SECONDS!
整整三秒！

01:20.981 --> 01:22.916
I'M GONNA TRY
FOR FIVE SECONDS NEXT!
我要尝试
接下来五秒钟！

01:22.916 --> 01:25.153
[big inhale]
[大吸一口气]

01:25.153 --> 01:28.156
- KEEP THAT UP AND YOU'LL
LOSE CONSCIOUSNESS...
- 坚持下去，你就会
失去知觉...

01:28.156 --> 01:29.857
TENTACLES CROSSED.
触手交叉。

01:29.857 --> 01:31.425
- [through held breath]
SILLY SQUIDWARD.
- [屏住呼吸]
愚蠢的章鱼哥。

01:31.425 --> 01:33.561
I'M NOT GONNA--
我不会——

01:33.561 --> 01:38.199
- WHAT'S GOIN' ON
AROUND HERE?
- 发生了什么事
在这附近吗？

01:38.199 --> 01:40.801
- [groggy babbling]
- [昏昏沉沉的胡言乱语]

01:40.801 --> 01:43.804
- WELL, I COULD BE ASKIN' YOU
THE SAME THING, BOY!
- 好吧，我可以问你
同样的事情，男孩！

01:43.804 --> 01:45.239
- SORRY, MR. KRABS.
- 对不起，先生。螃蟹。

01:45.239 --> 01:48.176
I WAS MERELY EMULATING
MY LATEST MEDIA OBSESSION...
我只是在模仿
我最近对媒体的痴迷......

01:48.176 --> 01:50.378
[sing-songy]
KENNY THE CAT!
[唱歌]
肯尼猫！

01:50.378 --> 01:51.879
- "KENNY THE CAT"?
- “肯尼猫”？

01:51.879 --> 01:54.582
WHAT IN CLAM'S NAME
IS A "THE CAT"?
蛤蜊的名字是什么
是“猫”吗？

01:54.582 --> 01:55.983
- HE'S THE GREATEST
UNDERSEA ATHLETE
- 他是最伟大的
海底运动员

01:55.983 --> 01:58.186
TO ORIGINATE FROM ABOVE
THE WET 'N' BRINY!
从上而下
潮湿的“N”盐水！

01:58.186 --> 02:00.188
AND HE'S BEEN
SHATTERING RECORDS ALL OVER,
他一直是
打破所有记录，

02:00.188 --> 02:02.323
HOLDING HIS BREATH
AS HE WALKS THE OCEAN FLOOR.
屏住呼吸
当他在海底行走时。

02:02.323 --> 02:03.957
I WANT TO BE JUST LIKE
KENNY THE CAT!
我想成为像
肯尼猫！

02:03.957 --> 02:07.928
[inhales]
[吸气]

02:07.928 --> 02:09.297
THAT'S WHAT HE DOES.
这就是他所做的。

02:09.297 --> 02:11.232
HE WALKS LIKE THAT
AND HOLDS HIS BREATH LIKE THAT!
他这样走路
并且屏住呼吸！

02:11.232 --> 02:13.033
KENNY IS A SENSATIONALITY!
肯尼是个轰动人物！

02:13.033 --> 02:15.903
HAVEN'T YOU NOTICED MY RECENT
LETTUCE CUSTOMIZATIONS?
你有没有注意到我最近的
生菜定制？

02:15.903 --> 02:17.671
- NO.
- 不。

02:17.671 --> 02:19.373
- AND YOU HAVEN'T
PERUSED MY COLLECTION
- 而你还没有
仔细阅读了我的收藏

02:19.373 --> 02:20.908
OF KENNY THE CAT PERIODICALS?
肯尼猫期刊？

02:20.908 --> 02:24.212
OR NOTICED KENNY ON EVERY
TV CHANNEL KNOWN TO FISHKIND?
或者注意到肯尼在每一个
Fishkind 知道的电视频道吗？

02:24.212 --> 02:25.313
- UH, NO.
- 呃，不。

02:25.313 --> 02:26.780
- BUT WHAT ABOUT
THE KENNY THE CAT BLIMP,
- 但是呢
肯尼猫飞艇，

02:26.780 --> 02:28.949
WHICH HOVERS OVER
KENNY THE CAT SPORTS STADIUM?
悬停在上面
肯尼猫体育场？

02:28.949 --> 02:30.984
- NEVER NOTICED IT.
- HUH.
- 从来没有注意到它。
- 嗯。

02:30.984 --> 02:32.386
YOU HAVEN'T SEEN HIM
IN YOUR WALLET?
你还没见过他
在你的钱包里吗？

02:32.386 --> 02:34.054
- [gasps]
ME WALLET?
- [喘气]
我的钱包？

02:34.054 --> 02:36.557
WHAT'S HE BEEN
DOIN' IN THERE?
他是谁
在那里做什么？

02:36.557 --> 02:38.259
- OH, HE'S ON
ALL THE NEW $50 BILLS.
- 哦，他来了
所有新的 50 美元钞票。

02:38.259 --> 02:41.862
- OH, THAT KENNY THE CAT!
- 哦，那只肯尼猫！

02:41.862 --> 02:43.731
WELL, HE'S A SENSATIONALITY!
嗯，他真是个轰动人物！

02:43.731 --> 02:46.534
- YEAH! AND HE'S VISITING
BIKINI BOTTOM TOMORROW,
- 是的！他来访了
明天的比基尼泳裤，

02:46.534 --> 02:48.836
WITH HUNDREDS OF HIS
RABIDLY LOYAL FANS!
与他的数百个
狂热的忠实粉丝！

02:48.836 --> 02:49.937
- HUNDREDS, YOU SAY?
- 你说有数百个？

02:49.937 --> 02:51.239
- MAYBE EVEN A THOUSAND!
- 甚至可能是一千！

02:51.239 --> 02:52.373
[cash register dings]
[收银机叮叮声]

02:52.373 --> 02:54.107
- SAY, KIDDO,
- 说吧，孩子，

02:54.107 --> 02:56.777
WHY DON'T YOU SEE
IF YOU CAN'T GET OL' KENNY
你为什么不看到
如果你找不到老肯尼

02:56.777 --> 02:58.346
AND HIS THRONG OF FANS
和他的粉丝群

02:58.346 --> 03:01.282
TO VISIT THE OL'
KRUSTY KRAB FOR A WHILE?
拜访 OL'
甲壳蟹一段时间了？

03:01.282 --> 03:03.384
- I SHALL DO
MY KRUSTIEST, SIR!
- 我会做
我最信任的，先生！

03:05.519 --> 03:07.421
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

03:07.421 --> 03:08.956
- [gasps]
SPONGEBOB!
- [喘气]
海绵宝宝！

03:08.956 --> 03:10.424
DON'T YOU WANT
YOUR WATER HELMET?
你不想要吗
你的水头盔？

03:10.424 --> 03:11.425
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

03:11.425 --> 03:12.760
NOT NECESSARY, SANDY.
没必要，桑迪。

03:12.760 --> 03:15.296
LIKE MY PERSONAL HERO,
KENNY THE CAT,
就像我的个人英雄一样，
肯尼猫，

03:15.296 --> 03:16.764
I'M A-OKAY!
我很好！

03:16.764 --> 03:20.401
[gasps for air]
[喘气]

03:21.802 --> 03:23.604
- WELL, IF YOU AIN'T
GONNA USE YOUR HELMET,
- 好吧，如果你不是
要使用你的头盔，

03:23.604 --> 03:24.972
I SUGGEST YOU MAKE IT QUICK,
SPONGEBOB.
我建议你快点，
海绵宝宝。

03:24.972 --> 03:26.073
- AH!
- 啊！

03:26.073 --> 03:27.441
HEY, SANDY,
嘿，桑迪，

03:27.441 --> 03:28.809
YOU'RE KIND OF LIKE
A CAT, AREN'T YOU?
你有点像
一只猫，不是吗？

03:28.809 --> 03:30.844
- CAT?
- 猫？

03:30.844 --> 03:33.281
IN WHAT WAY AM I
"KIND OF LIKE A CAT"?
我是怎样的
“有点像猫”？

03:33.281 --> 03:34.448
- WELL,
AREN'T CATS AND SQUIRRELS
- 嗯，
不是猫和松鼠吗

03:34.448 --> 03:35.616
BASICALLY THE SAME THING?
基本上是一样的吗？

03:35.616 --> 03:37.117
- WE ARE BOTH MAMMALS,
- 我们都是哺乳动物，

03:37.117 --> 03:40.187
BUT THAT IS WHERE
THE SIMILARITIES END!
但这就是地方
相似之处结束！

03:40.187 --> 03:42.790
CATS ARE NO-GOOD SCOUNDRELS,
猫不是好恶棍，

03:42.790 --> 03:44.858
AND I AIN'T NEVER
TRUSTED ONE OF 'EM!
我从来没有
值得信赖的其中之一！

03:44.858 --> 03:46.560
- WELL, YOU CAN TRUST
KENNY THE!
- 嗯，你可以信赖
肯尼！

03:46.560 --> 03:48.362
HE'S THE HEROIC CAT
WHO'S BEEN HOLDING HIS BREATH
他是英雄猫
谁一直屏住呼吸

03:48.362 --> 03:49.730
FOR DAYS AT A TIME!
一次持续几天！

03:49.730 --> 03:51.965
- I HATE TO PRECIPITATE
ON YOUR PARTY, SPONGEBOB,
- 我讨厌沉淀
在你的派对上，海绵宝宝，

03:51.965 --> 03:53.734
BUT THAT IS IMPOSSIBLE!
但这是不可能的！

03:53.734 --> 03:56.169
NO AIR BREATHER
COULD EVER DO THAT!
无空气呼吸器
可以做到这一点！

03:56.169 --> 03:57.438
NOT EVEN ME!
甚至不是我！

03:57.438 --> 03:59.640
- VERY WELL, SANDRA,
IF THAT IS YOUR STANCE,
- 很好，桑德拉，
如果这是你的立场，

03:59.640 --> 04:00.708
THEN SO BE IT.
那么就这样吧。

04:00.708 --> 04:02.343
COULD SOMEONE BE JEALOUS
有人会嫉妒吗

04:02.343 --> 04:06.146
OF KENNY'S DAZZLING
LUNG CAPACITY?
肯尼的耀眼
肺活量？

04:06.146 --> 04:09.483
both: KENNY THE CAT!
KENNY THE CAT!
两人：肯尼猫！
肯尼猫！

04:09.483 --> 04:10.918
KENNY THE CAT!
肯尼猫！

04:10.918 --> 04:14.154
- YOU DO KNOW THAT KENNY
WON'T BE HERE UNTIL 10:00?
- 你知道肯尼
10:00 之前不会到这里吗？

04:14.154 --> 04:15.323
- UH-HUH.
- 呃哈。

04:15.323 --> 04:17.157
- TOMORROW MORNING.
- UH-HUH, YEAH.
- 明天早上。
- 嗯嗯，是的。

04:17.157 --> 04:20.127
14 HOURS IS CUTTING IT CLOSE,
BUT I HAD TO WORK ALL DAY!
14 小时即将结束，
但我必须整天工作！

04:20.127 --> 04:21.562
- HOPELESS.
- 绝望。

04:21.562 --> 04:24.131
- YOU KNOW, I READ
IN KENNY FANCY MAGAZINE
- 你知道，我读过
肯尼时尚杂志

04:24.131 --> 04:25.733
THAT HE'S SO USED TO
HOLDING HIS BREATH,
他已经习惯了
屏住呼吸，

04:25.733 --> 04:28.201
THAT WHEN HE'S TOPSIDE,
HE FORGETS TO BREATHE!
当他在顶部时，
他忘记了呼吸！

04:28.201 --> 04:29.603
- WOW!
[laughs]
- 哇！
[笑]

04:29.603 --> 04:32.172
WELL, THAT'D BE LIKE ME
FORGETTING TO--
嗯，那就像我一样
忘记——

04:32.172 --> 04:34.342
[gasps]
[喘气]

04:34.342 --> 04:35.443
[sighs with relief]
[松了口气]

04:35.443 --> 04:38.346
THERE YOU ARE,
POCKET TACO!
你在那里，
口袋炸玉米饼！

04:38.346 --> 04:39.980
[munching]
[咀嚼]

04:39.980 --> 04:40.981
[swallows]
[燕子]

04:40.981 --> 04:41.982
- AHH.
-啊啊。

04:41.982 --> 04:43.351
PATRICK,
HAVE YOU EVER GAZED
帕特里克，
你有没有凝视过

04:43.351 --> 04:44.618
UP INTO THE STARRY NIGHT
进入星夜

04:44.618 --> 04:46.186
AND SEEN
KENNY THE CAT'S FACE?
和看到的
肯尼猫的脸？

04:46.186 --> 04:47.455
- NO.
- 不。

04:47.455 --> 04:49.357
- FIND
THE GROUPER CONSTELLATION
- 寻找
石斑鱼星座

04:49.357 --> 04:51.659
AND THE DORSAL CONSTELLATION,
和背侧星座，

04:51.659 --> 04:53.361
THEN SQUINT YOUR EYES
然后眯起眼睛

04:53.361 --> 04:55.929
AND LET THE DETAILS
FALL INTO PLACE.
让细节
就位。

04:55.929 --> 04:57.164
- UH...
- 呃...

04:57.164 --> 04:58.566
OH.
哦。

04:58.566 --> 05:00.368
I DON'T SEE IT.
我没看到。

05:00.368 --> 05:03.504
KENNY'S REALLY GOTTEN
INTO YOUR HEAD LATELY.
肯尼真的得到了
最近进入你的脑海。

05:03.504 --> 05:05.373
- YEAH.
KENNY'S AWESOME.
- 是的。
肯尼太棒了。

05:05.373 --> 05:07.040
HEY!
THAT REMINDS ME!
嘿！
这让我想起了！

05:07.040 --> 05:10.411
LET'S PAINT OUR FACES
TO LOOK LIKE KENNY!
让我们画我们的脸
看起来像肯尼！

05:10.411 --> 05:12.079
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

05:12.079 --> 05:13.381
PERFECT!
完美的！

05:13.381 --> 05:15.416
WE'RE THE BIGGEST
KENNY THE CAT FANS EVER!
我们是最大的
肯尼是猫迷！

05:15.416 --> 05:18.285
- THIS, UH,
IS GETTING CREEPY.
- 这个，呃，
越来越令人毛骨悚然。

05:18.285 --> 05:19.453
- HEY, BUDDY,
CHECK IT OUT!
- 嘿，伙计，
检查一下！

05:19.453 --> 05:21.389
- SWEET NEPTUNE!
- 甜蜜的海王星！

05:21.389 --> 05:24.392
HEY, SPONGEBOB,
I'M GONNA GO NOW.
嘿，海绵宝宝，
我现在要走了。

05:24.392 --> 05:26.827
YOUR OBSESSION WITH KENNY
IS GETTING WEIRD.
您对肯尼的痴迷
越来越奇怪了。

05:26.827 --> 05:28.061
- BUT YOU DIDN'T EVEN
GET TO SEE
- 但你甚至没有
参观

05:28.061 --> 05:29.930
MY NEW KENNY THE CAT
TEMPORARY TATTOO!
我的新猫肯尼
临时纹身！

05:29.930 --> 05:30.931
- OH, THAT'S OKAY.
- 哦，没关系。

05:30.931 --> 05:32.099
SEE YA, SPONGEBOB!
再见，海绵宝宝！

05:32.099 --> 05:34.134
- WELL, I GUESS
IT'S PLAIN TO SEE
- 嗯，我猜
IT'S PLAIN TO SEE

05:34.134 --> 05:36.537
WHO THE TRUE
KENNY THE CAT FAN IS!
谁是真实的
肯尼是猫迷！

05:37.605 --> 05:38.606
[alarm rings and meows]
[警报声和喵喵声]

05:38.606 --> 05:41.609
10:00! KENNY TIME!
10:00！肯尼时间！

05:41.609 --> 05:43.477
- LADIES AND GENTLEMEN,
- 女士们，先生们，

05:43.477 --> 05:46.113
NOW IS THE TIME
YOU'VE ALL BEEN WAITING FOR!
现在是时候了
YOU'VE ALL BEEN WAITING FOR!

05:46.113 --> 05:49.783
KENNY THE CAT WILL DO
HIS SIGNATURE WALK!
肯尼猫会做的
他的标志性步行！

05:49.783 --> 05:51.519
[cheering]
[欢呼]

05:51.519 --> 05:52.820
- KENNY!
- 肯尼！

05:52.820 --> 05:54.822
[marker squeaks]
- THANKS, KENNY!
[标记吱吱声]
- 谢谢，肯尼！

05:54.822 --> 05:56.557
- KENNY, SIR,
IT WOULD MEAN A LOT
- 肯尼先生，
这意义重大

05:56.557 --> 05:58.759
IF YOU'D SIGN MY OFFICIAL
KENNY THE CAT SPATULA.
如果您愿意签署我的正式文件
肯尼猫铲。

05:58.759 --> 06:00.861
[marker squeaks]
THANKS, KENNY.
[标记吱吱声]
谢谢，肯尼。

06:00.861 --> 06:02.596
YOU'RE SO REAL.
你太真实了。

06:02.596 --> 06:04.197
[Kenny's stomach growls]
[肯尼的肚子咕咕叫]

06:04.197 --> 06:05.699
OH, YOU'RE HUNGRY?
哦，你饿了吗？

06:05.699 --> 06:07.167
WHAT DO YOU SAY WE MOVE
THIS AUTOGRAPH SESSION
你说我们搬家怎么样
本次签名会

06:07.167 --> 06:08.301
TO THE KRUSTY KRAB?
去脆皮蟹吗？

06:08.301 --> 06:09.302
[ding]
[叮]

06:09.302 --> 06:10.938
[babbles]
[胡言乱语]

06:10.938 --> 06:12.172
DID YOU SEE THAT?
你看到了吗？

06:12.172 --> 06:13.306
KENNY JUST GAVE ME
肯尼刚刚给了我

06:13.306 --> 06:15.943
HIS TRADEMARK
A-OKAY HAND SIGN!
他的商标
好的手势！

06:15.943 --> 06:19.146
SWOON! SWOON!
昏厥！昏厥！

06:19.146 --> 06:20.981
[excited chatter]
[兴奋的喋喋不休]

06:20.981 --> 06:23.884
- ONE AT A TIME!
ONE AT A TIME, PLEASE!
- 一次一个！
请一次一个！

06:23.884 --> 06:25.453
KENNY THE CAT
WILL HAVE TIME
肯尼猫
会有时间

06:25.453 --> 06:27.621
TO MEET EACH
AND EVERY ONE OF YOUSE.
满足每一个
还有你们每一个人。

06:27.621 --> 06:29.156
AND I WILL HAVE TIME
TO TAKE
我会有时间
采取

06:29.156 --> 06:31.459
EACH AND EVERY ONE
OF YOUR DOLLARS!
每一位
您的美元！

06:31.459 --> 06:32.660
LOOK AT MESELF!
看看我自己！

06:32.660 --> 06:35.362
I'M NOT BEING
A VERY GOOD HOST!
我不是
非常好的房东！

06:35.362 --> 06:36.530
UH, EXCUSE ME!
呃，对不起！

06:36.530 --> 06:38.499
YOU JUST MAKE YOURSELF
AT HOME, KENNY!
你只要做你自己
在家，肯尼！

06:38.499 --> 06:40.834
I MEAN,
"MISTER THE CAT"!
我的意思是，
“猫先生”！

06:40.834 --> 06:44.137
HERE YA GO.
CONDIMENTS, ON THE HOUSE!
来吧。
调味品，在家里！

06:44.137 --> 06:45.706
DON'T TELL ANYBODY!
不要告诉任何人！

06:45.706 --> 06:49.477
WELCOME TO
THE KRUSTY KRAB FAMILY.
欢迎来到
蟹堡王家族。

06:49.477 --> 06:52.079
[chuckles]
[笑声]

06:52.079 --> 06:54.381
- MISTER THE CAT,
EVERYTHING OKAY?
- 猫先生，
一切都好吗？

06:54.381 --> 06:57.918
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

06:57.918 --> 07:00.187
- SAY, MR. KRABS, IT'S GONNA
BE A LONG DAY FOR KENNY.
- 说吧，先生。蟹蟹，它会的
对肯尼来说这是漫长的一天。

07:00.187 --> 07:02.055
HOW ABOUT WE GIVE HIM A MINUTE
TO FRESHEN UP?
我们给他一分钟怎么样
焕然一新？

07:02.055 --> 07:04.625
- WHAT AN EXCELLENT IDEA,
SPONGEBOB.
- 多么好的主意啊
海绵宝宝。

07:04.625 --> 07:07.260
A CLEAN CAT IS
A MONEYMAKING CAT,
干净的猫是
一只赚钱的猫，

07:07.260 --> 07:08.662
I ALWAYS SAY.
我总是说。

07:08.662 --> 07:12.332
PLEASE AVAIL YOURSELF
OF THE LOUNGE FACILITIES.
请自行利用
休息室设施。

07:12.332 --> 07:14.502
- WELL, I BEST GET BACK
TO MANNING THE GRILL.
- 好吧，我最好回去
去烧烤店工作。

07:18.071 --> 07:21.241
- THIS GETS REAL UNCOMFORTABLE
AFTER AWHILE.
- 这真的很不舒服
过了一会儿。

07:21.241 --> 07:22.910
[inhales]
[吸气]

07:22.910 --> 07:24.211
[gargling]
[漱口]

07:26.279 --> 07:27.515
- SORRY TO BOTHER YOU,
MISTER THE CAT.
- 抱歉打扰您，
猫先生。

07:27.515 --> 07:28.582
I JUST THOUGHT YOU'D
LIKE A BITE TO--
我只是以为你会
喜欢咬一口——

07:28.582 --> 07:29.583
WHOA!
哇啊！

07:29.583 --> 07:30.884
- [inhales]
- [吸气]

07:30.884 --> 07:33.587
[exhales]
[呼气]

07:33.587 --> 07:34.922
- [trembling]
- [颤抖]

07:34.922 --> 07:37.525
- GOOD THING I GOT
THIS OXYGEN TANK AND MASK,
- 我得到的好东西
这个氧气罐和面罩，

07:37.525 --> 07:39.527
OTHERWISE THERE'S NO WAY
I'D BE ABLE
不然没办法
我能够

07:39.527 --> 07:41.862
TO HOLD MY BREATH THIS LONG.
屏住呼吸这么久。

07:41.862 --> 07:45.566
- [trembling]
- [颤抖]

07:45.566 --> 07:47.267
HOW COULD YOU, KENNY?
你怎么能，肯尼？

07:47.267 --> 07:49.369
YOU BROKE MY HEART.
你伤了我的心。

07:49.369 --> 07:51.839
HERE I WAS THIS ENTIRE TIME
BELIEVING YOUR ACT,
我一直都在这里
相信你的行为，

07:51.839 --> 07:55.108
ONLY TO DISCOVER THAT
IT WAS NOTHING BUT AN ACT.
只是为了发现这一点
这只不过是一种行为。

07:55.108 --> 07:57.845
- BUT IT'S NOT
WHAT YOU THINK.
- 但事实并非如此
你的想法。

07:57.845 --> 07:59.713
- THERE'S NO ROOM
FOR THOUGHTS NOW--
- 没有空间了
现在想一想——

07:59.713 --> 08:02.015
ONLY FOR TEARS.
NO!
只为泪水。
不！

08:02.015 --> 08:04.317
- SPONGEBOB, WAIT!
- 海绵宝宝，等等！

08:04.317 --> 08:06.253
WHOA.
哇哦。

08:06.253 --> 08:08.556
[inhales deeply]
[深吸一口气]

08:08.556 --> 08:11.559
- I CAN'T BELIEVE
I FELL FOR SUCH A PHONY.
- 我不敢相信
我爱上了这样一个骗子。

08:11.559 --> 08:13.026
[sniffles]
OH, WELL.
[抽鼻子]
哦，好吧。

08:13.026 --> 08:14.361
TIME TO MOVE ON.
是时候继续前进了。

08:14.361 --> 08:15.996
I GUESS I DON'T NEED
MY KENNY THE CAT
我想我不需要
我的肯尼猫

08:15.996 --> 08:18.932
FAN CLUB MEMBERSHIP CARD
ANYMORE...
粉丝俱乐部会员卡
还有...

08:18.932 --> 08:21.468
OR THESE KENNY THE CAT
POSTERS.
或者这些肯尼猫
海报。

08:21.468 --> 08:23.236
OH, KENNY, HOW COULD YOU?
哦，肯尼，你怎么能？

08:23.236 --> 08:26.106
[crying]
YOU WERE MY IDOL.
[哭泣]
你是我的偶像。

08:26.106 --> 08:27.841
YOU KNOW, I SHOULD REALLY
TALK ABOUT THIS WITH SOMEONE
你知道，我真的应该
与某人谈论此事

08:27.841 --> 08:30.077
OR I MIGHT GET DEPRESSED.
否则我可能会感到沮丧。

08:30.077 --> 08:33.847
- SPONGEBOB, PLEASE,
LET ME EXPLAIN.
- 海绵宝宝，拜托，
让我解释一下。

08:33.847 --> 08:36.717
I'M JUST A CAT
WITH A DREAM--
我只是一只猫
怀揣梦想——

08:36.717 --> 08:40.120
A DREAM TO GIVE
THE GIFT OF HOPE.
给予的梦想
希望的礼物。

08:40.120 --> 08:44.124
SEE, ABOVE WATER,
I'M A NOBODY--
看，在水面之上，
我什么都不是——

08:44.124 --> 08:46.760
JUST ANOTHER ANNOYING CAT.
只是另一只烦人的猫。

08:46.760 --> 08:50.230
BUT DOWN HERE,
I'M SOMEONE SPECIAL,
但在这里，
我是一个特别的人，

08:50.230 --> 08:52.833
SOMEONE WHO CAN
MAKE PEOPLE HAPPY.
有能力的人
让人们快乐。

08:52.833 --> 08:55.235
AND IF MAKING THE WORLD
A HAPPIER PLACE
如果创造世界
一个更快乐的地方

08:55.235 --> 08:56.970
MAKES ME A CRIMINAL...
让我成为一个罪犯......

08:56.970 --> 08:58.672
[crying]
[哭泣]

08:58.672 --> 09:02.509
THEN LOCK ME UP
AND THROW AWAY THE KEY.
然后把我关起来
并扔掉钥匙。

09:02.509 --> 09:04.945
HAVE MERCY!
怜悯吧！

09:04.945 --> 09:06.046
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

09:06.046 --> 09:07.214
- ALL RIGHT, KENNY,
ALL RIGHT.
- 好吧，肯尼，
好吧。

09:07.214 --> 09:08.515
I PROMISE I WON'T
TELL ANYONE.
我保证我不会
告诉任何人。

09:08.515 --> 09:10.350
- REALLY?
- YES, REALLY.
- 真的吗？
- 是的，真的。

09:10.350 --> 09:11.819
- ALL RIGHT!
- 好的！

09:11.819 --> 09:13.186
THANKS, BUB.
谢谢，布布。

09:13.186 --> 09:15.823
YOU'RE THE BEST FRIEND
I EVER HAD.
你是最好的朋友
我曾经有过。

09:15.823 --> 09:18.325
NOW IF YOU'LL EXCUSE MOI,
现在请原谅我，

09:18.325 --> 09:21.528
I GOTTA SIGN SOME AUTOGRAPHS.
我得签名一些。

09:21.528 --> 09:24.397
- AH, THE CAT OF THE HOUR
IS BACK.
- 啊，当下的猫
回来了。

09:24.397 --> 09:27.467
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

09:27.467 --> 09:30.871
ALL RIGHT. YOU READY TO SIGN
FOR THESE FINE DOLLARS--
好的。您准备好签名了
为了这些好钱——

09:30.871 --> 09:32.072
I MEAN, UH, SUCKERS--
我的意思是，呃，傻瓜们——

09:32.072 --> 09:33.774
I MEAN, UH,
SOME AUTOGRAPHS.
我的意思是，呃，
一些签名。

09:33.774 --> 09:35.809
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

09:35.809 --> 09:37.210
WELL, ALL RIGHTY THEN.
好吧，那么好吧。

09:37.210 --> 09:40.213
THAT'S WHAT THE CONSUMING PUBLIC
WANTS TO HEAR.
这就是大众消费
想听。

09:40.213 --> 09:41.749
- SIR, I JUST WANNA SAY THAT
- 先生，我只是想说

09:41.749 --> 09:42.983
YOU'RE THE BIGGEST INSPIRATION
你是最大的灵感

09:42.983 --> 09:44.752
MYSELF AND MY FRIENDS
HAVE EVER KNOWN.
我自己和我的朋友们
曾经知道过。

09:44.752 --> 09:46.186
YOUR ABILITY
TO HOLD YOUR BREATH
你的能力
屏住呼吸

09:46.186 --> 09:48.221
HAS CHANGED OUR LIVES
FOREVER.
改变了我们的生活
永远。

09:48.221 --> 09:50.390
[all grunting]
[全都咕哝]

09:52.660 --> 09:54.527
- "YOU'RE WELCOME.
I'VE BEEN HOLDING MY BREATH
- “不客气。
我一直屏住呼吸

09:54.527 --> 09:56.664
"FOR MORE THAN 20 YEARS,
NO PROBLEM.
“20多年来，
没问题。

09:56.664 --> 10:00.634
YOU CAN TOO, SIGNED
KENNY THE BREATH-HOLDING CAT."
你也可以，签名
肯尼是一只屏气猫。”

10:00.634 --> 10:01.635
- HI, KENNY.
- 嗨，肯尼。

10:01.635 --> 10:03.203
MIND IF I GET YOUR SIGNATURE?
介意我得到你的签名吗？

10:03.203 --> 10:04.905
GEE, IT SURE IS NICE
TO MEET ANOTHER
哎呀，这确实很好
遇见另一个人

10:04.905 --> 10:07.374
AIR-BREATHING, WARM-BLOODED
VARMINT DOWN HERE.
呼吸空气、温血
恶鼠在这里。

10:07.374 --> 10:08.742
- MM-HMM.
- 嗯嗯。

10:08.742 --> 10:10.978
- JUST OUT OF SCIENTIFIC
CURIOSITY,
- 不科学
好奇心，

10:10.978 --> 10:13.446
HOW DO YOU HOLD YOUR BREATH
FOR SO LONG?
你如何屏住呼吸
这么久了？

10:13.446 --> 10:14.915
- UH, WE NEEDN'T
BURDEN OURSELVES
- 呃，我们不需要
我们自己有负担

10:14.915 --> 10:17.584
WITH SUCH NEEDLESS SCIENTIFIC
TECHNICALITIES, SANDY.
如此毫无必要的科学
技术，桑迪。

10:17.584 --> 10:19.386
- I'M JUST WONDERING,
SPONGEBOB.
- 我只是想知道，
海绵宝宝。

10:19.386 --> 10:22.622
I MEAN, HE DOES DEFY
ALL SCIENTIFIC LOGIC,
我的意思是，他确实反抗
所有科学逻辑，

10:22.622 --> 10:24.825
CONSIDERING THE FACT
THAT ALL AIR-BREATHING MAMMALS
考虑到事实
所有呼吸空气的哺乳动物

10:24.825 --> 10:26.760
NEED OXYGEN
TO THE BRAIN AND LUNGS
需要氧气
到达大脑和肺部

10:26.760 --> 10:29.629
TO SURVIVE FOR MORE THAN
THREE MINUTES.
生存超过
三分钟。

10:29.629 --> 10:31.598
- HEY, MAYBE WE SHOULD
SHOW OUR FINE GUEST
- 嘿，也许我们应该
展示我们的好客人

10:31.598 --> 10:33.466
A LITTLE MORE HOSPITALITY, HM?
热情一点吧，嗯？

10:33.466 --> 10:35.769
- WHAT HAS GOTTEN INTO YOU,
SPONGEBOB?
- 你怎么了？
海绵宝宝？

10:35.769 --> 10:38.005
CAN'T I TALK ABOUT
WHAT MUST SURELY BE HAPPENING
我不能谈谈吗
肯定会发生什么

10:38.005 --> 10:40.273
FROM A BIOLOGICAL STANDPOINT?
从生物学的角度来看？

10:40.273 --> 10:42.442
I MEAN, LIKE,
THE LACK OF OXYGEN
我的意思是，就像，
缺氧

10:42.442 --> 10:45.145
WILL TIGHTEN THE CAPILLARIES
IN THE LUNGS,
会收紧毛细血管
在肺部，

10:45.145 --> 10:47.715
CAUSING A DANGEROUS LEVEL
OF CARBON MONOXIDE
造成危险水平
一氧化碳

10:47.715 --> 10:50.784
TO RISE IN THE BLOODSTREAM,
WHICH IN TURN
在血液中崛起，
反过来

10:50.784 --> 10:53.586
LEADS TO A GHOSTLY BLUE COLOR
TO THE SKIN,
呈现出幽灵般的蓝色
对皮肤来说，

10:53.586 --> 10:56.156
FOLLOWED BY
EVENTUAL UNCONSCIOUSNESS.
紧随其后
最终失去意识。

10:56.156 --> 10:58.291
- I CAN'T TAKE IT!
- 我受不了！

10:58.291 --> 11:01.594
I NEED OXYGEN!
我需要氧气！

11:03.630 --> 11:04.998
[all gasp]
[全都喘气]

11:04.998 --> 11:06.566
[inhales deeply]
[深吸一口气]

11:06.566 --> 11:08.235
AHH.
啊啊。

11:08.235 --> 11:10.203
- I KNEW KENNY WAS A FAKE.
- 我知道肯尼是假的。

11:10.203 --> 11:12.272
[all grumbling]
[大家都在抱怨]

11:12.272 --> 11:13.640
- LIAR!
- 骗子！

11:13.640 --> 11:15.743
- NO! COME BACK.
- 不！回来。

11:15.743 --> 11:19.546
AH, THANKS A LOT,
YOU AIR-BREATHING CHARLATAN.
啊，非常感谢，
你这个呼吸空气的江湖骗子。

11:19.546 --> 11:23.751
AND YOU CAN FORGET ABOUT
THESE FREE CONDIMENTS TOO.
你可以忘记
这些还有免费的调味品。

11:23.751 --> 11:25.118
- GEE, KENNY.
- 哎呀，肯尼。

11:25.118 --> 11:27.554
I SURE AM SORRY
IF I RUINED YOUR CAREER.
我真的很抱歉
如果我毁了你的职业生涯。

11:27.554 --> 11:29.790
- AW, IT'S OKAY, SPONGEBOB.
- 噢，没关系，海绵宝宝。

11:29.790 --> 11:32.760
MAYBE THE WHOLE SHAMBLE
IS A BIG WAKE-UP CALL
也许是整个混乱
这是一个巨大的警钟

11:32.760 --> 11:34.762
TO BE HONEST.
说实话。

11:34.762 --> 11:36.263
- HEY, I GOT AN IDEA.
- 嘿，我有一个主意。

11:36.263 --> 11:38.465
MOST CATS HATE WATER, RIGHT?
大多数猫讨厌水，对吗？

11:38.465 --> 11:40.934
WELL, YOU CAN BE THE CAT
THAT LIKES WATER.
好吧，你可以成为猫
喜欢水。

11:40.934 --> 11:42.402
THAT WAY,
YOU'RE STILL SPECIAL.
这样，
你仍然很特别。

11:42.402 --> 11:44.637
- I LIKE IT!
- 我喜欢它！

11:44.637 --> 11:47.374
- JUST GET OUT OF HERE
ALREADY.
- 离开这里
已经。

11:47.374 --> 11:50.778
YOU CAN NEVER TRUST A CAT--
OR IS IT A DOG?
你永远不能相信猫——
或者它是一只狗？

你永远不能相信猫——
或者它是一只狗？